WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.240
An imagined letter, about a note

2
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.650
that is real.

3
00:00:05.177 --> 00:00:08.157
I cannot sleep, so I am writing.

4
00:00:08.157 --> 00:00:10.877
My drawing board says one thing,

5
00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:13.277
my conscience another, and my

6
00:00:13.277 --> 00:00:15.457
doubts multiply like mice in a

7
00:00:15.457 --> 00:00:16.607
grain store.

8
00:00:17.135 --> 00:00:19.135
Then someone read me a note

9
00:00:19.135 --> 00:00:21.455
Gandhiji once wrote to a friend

10
00:00:21.455 --> 00:00:23.355
tormented by doubts.

11
00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:25.615
He calls it a talisman.

12
00:00:25.615 --> 00:00:27.905
I copied it out for you.

13
00:00:28.329 --> 00:00:30.309
Recall the face of the poorest

14
00:00:30.309 --> 00:00:32.449
and the most helpless man whom

15
00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:34.689
you may have seen, and ask

16
00:00:34.689 --> 00:00:36.209
yourself if the step you

17
00:00:36.209 --> 00:00:38.189
contemplate is going to be of

18
00:00:38.189 --> 00:00:39.609
any use to him.

19
00:00:39.609 --> 00:00:41.849
Will it restore him to a control

20
00:00:41.849 --> 00:00:44.459
over his own life and destiny?

21
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.420
So I held my canal plan against

22
00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:48.180
that test.

23
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:50.260
Whose field does it reach?

24
00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:51.280
Whose well?

25
00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.540
Half my lines ran to the

26
00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:54.840
landlord's land.

27
00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.770
I tore up the sheet.

28
00:00:57.178 --> 00:00:59.598
Your doubts, and yourself, will

29
00:00:59.598 --> 00:01:01.838
melt away, it promises.

30
00:01:01.838 --> 00:01:04.118
Mine have not melted, but they

31
00:01:04.118 --> 00:01:06.058
now queue politely, like a

32
00:01:06.058 --> 00:01:07.308
ration shop.

33
00:01:08.341 --> 00:01:09.101
For GS4:

34
00:01:09.101 --> 00:01:11.681
the talisman is a test for any

35
00:01:11.681 --> 00:01:12.301
public decision.

36
00:01:12.301 --> 00:01:15.321
Will it help the poorest person,

37
00:01:15.321 --> 00:01:18.101
and restore his control over his

38
00:01:18.101 --> 00:01:19.051
own life?

39
00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:23.159
By morning the lamp was low, and

40
00:01:23.159 --> 00:01:24.949
the plan was new.
